    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908240/extras/f6acf92e0a8d000ebf3b787fa7b8588a.avif?t=1716666932\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>Ralph is a veteran homicide detective who has a high service record. His reliable partner, and best friend, Nathan, has been with him for the past 5 years. Together, the two of them have solved multiple cases together.<br>One day, a strange killing occurs where the victim is bound in chains, and their skin is carved with a cryptic message. At the same time, Nathan disappears without a trace. Ralph grows worried for his friend when more killings with the same M.O. begin to appear. <br>While chasing clues, Ralph is partnered up with a rookie detective named Tyler who doesn't take his job seriously. Will Ralph be able to solve the mystery of the Chain Killings with his new carefree partner?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908240/extras/bb1e48e6d1dc4879477441e7f7258eb1.avif?t=1716666932\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908240/extras/3a030a67cd8beb7740cda59f61bd8691.avif?t=1716666932\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>A stone-faced detective who's always stressed out. Appears older than his age.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908240/extras/9dd682d4b7a4cbcac87505946e1d2e6a.avif?t=1716666932\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>A kind, compassionate detective who worries easily. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908240/extras/749d62807041693d2a145ed6cb3f0351.avif?t=1716666932\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>An impish rookie detective with a nonchalant attitude.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2908240/extras/2d18f99db682b0d5021dffd90d68a15f.avif?t=1716666932\" width=600 height=150 /></span><br>Investigate crime scenes<br>Interrogate witnesses and suspects<br>Solve puzzles<br>Partial voice acting<br><br><strong><i>DISCLAIMER!<br>CONTAINS blood, death, suicide, homicide, child abuse, tobacco and alcohol usage, violence, and profanity.</i></strong>",
